NexdWatch database migrations
=============================

PostgreSQL schema changes are managed by Alembic. Configure `.env`, ensure the
database is reachable through the `POSTGRES_*` settings, then apply every committed
revision with:

    alembic upgrade head

With Compose:

    docker compose run --rm api alembic upgrade head

Create a new revision only for an intentional schema change:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"

Review generated SQL and both upgrade/downgrade functions before committing. Never
edit, squash, rename, or reorder existing files in `alembic/versions`; deployed
databases identify them by revision ID.
